                    explanation: 'Sequence of Returns Risk is the retirement-specific danger that a crash in early retirement years permanently impairs the portfolio. The Bucket Solution: Bucket 1 (2-3 years of expenses in Liquid Fund) covers living costs without equity sales. Bucket 2 (bonds/hybrid) refills Bucket 1 annually from less-volatile assets. Bucket 3 (equity index fund) has 10+ years to recover from any crash before it needs to fund anything. This completely eliminates forced equity selling at market lows — the most common way retirement portfolios are permanently impaired.',
